    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HAE dedup\n\nEvery **30 minutes**, reads health_raw rows after the watermark and at or before **now minus 2 minutes** (UTC stamps).\n\n**Lock.** Only one run works at a time. The run reads the `health_raw_dedup_lock` row in hae_dedup_state. If another execution owns it and `lock_until` is still in the future, this run stops. Otherwise it writes its own execution id and now + **120 minutes**, waits 3 seconds, and continues only if it reads its own id back. The last item of the loop releases the lock (only if this execution still owns it). A failed run leaves the lock until `lock_until`, then the next tick takes it.\n\n**One record at a time** walks the Code node output in order: points, workouts, the watermark, then unlock. Each upsert finishes and returns to the loop before the next item. A failed upsert stops the loop, so the watermark does not move. The watermark is re-read and saved only if this run's value is later. Do not replace the loop with parallel branches.\n\nWithin one run the newest payload wins. Re-sends upsert the same `metric|ts` or `workout_id`. A run that lasts longer than 120 minutes loses the lock; raise `LOCK_MINUTES` in **Check lock is free** if backfills take that long.\n\nNo credentials and no outbound calls.\n\n### Before you publish\n- Pick each Data Table by id: `health_raw`, `hae_dedup_state` (seven nodes), `health_points`, `health_workouts`.\n- `hae_dedup_state` needs string columns `lock_owner` and `lock_until`.\n- **Settings → Timezone** same as workflows 01 and 03, and **Execution order v1**. Some imports drop both.\n- Successful, manual, and error executions are not saved. To inspect a failed upsert, temporarily turn error saving on, reproduce, then turn it off.\n\n### Constants — edit the node, not a variable\n- Schedule: **every 30 minutes**.\n- Settle delay: **2 minutes**.\n- Watermark row: **`health_raw_watermark`**.\n- Lock row: **`health_raw_dedup_lock`**, expiry **120 minutes** (`LOCK_MINUTES`).\n- Empty-watermark fallback: `1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z`.\n\n`received_at` on the watermark and `lock_until` are UTC `yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss.SSS'Z'`. `updated_at` is still local.",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "503f0670-afef-4c2b-bb6d-a5bb1f6115f4",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1520,
        -900
      ]
    },
